# documentation(wmean)
_wmean {basic.R}_

## Weighted mean of a column

------

### Description

Computes a weighted mean, dropping `NA` pairs.

### Usage

```r
wmean(x, w = rep(1, length(x)))
```

### Arguments

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| `x` | A numeric vector. |
| `w` | Weights, the same length as `x`. |

### Value

A length-1 double.

### Examples

```r
wmean(1:3, c(1, 1, 2))
```

