# documentation(summarise_wmean)
_summarise_wmean {basic.R}_

## Summarise a data frame column with `wmean()`

------

### Usage

```r
summarise_wmean(data, col, w)
```

### Arguments

|     |     |
| --- | --- |
| `data` | A data frame. |
| `col` | <`data-masked`> Column to summarise. |
| `w` | Weights, the same length as `x`. |

